    "description":"The uniform catalogue page at /admissions/uniform-catalogue/. Replaces apps/web/src/data/uniform.ts. ⚠ THE CATALOGUES THEMSELVES ARE NOW STRAPI MEDIA. They were two PDFs sitting in the site's public directory (51 MB), so publishing a new edition meant a developer and a deploy; it is now an upload. ⚠ EVERYTHING BELOW THE CATALOGUES IS READ OUT OF THEM — the class groups, the seasons, the shoe table and the school's own eleven notes are transcriptions, not this project's wording, and the shoe table keeps the document's own 2023-24 session heading even though the cover says 2025-26."},
